# Scacelith - Dansk
# Translation of assets/i18n/en.lang (same keys, same {n}). Plurals: one|other.
# Register: informal "du", as in all Danish software; buttons are imperatives or nouns. Titles are
# in capitals (title face). Chess terms follow the Danish glossary (parti, træk, skak, mat, remis,
# pat, rokade, noteringsblanket, betænkningstid). Quotation marks »…«; decimal comma.
# "Thinking time" (Stockfish's pause before a move) is "tænketid", so that "betænkningstid" always
# means the time control. The coach is "træneren" and "han" (a male teacher, as in the coach files).

